      "content": "The override passes the quoted directory-existence check but is then expanded unquoted into shell source. An existing TJ_E2E_CURRENT directory containing spaces will be split into multiple Playwright filters; shell metacharacters in its name will instead be interpreted by bash. Execute Playwright with an argument array (passing \"$current\" as one argument), or shell-escape the path when constructing cmd2.",
